# Vector Tile Placeholder
# This is a placeholder file. You need to generate actual .pbf vector tiles from your GeoJSON data.
# 
# To generate vector tiles:
# 1. Install tippecanoe: brew install tippecanoe (macOS) or apt-get install tippecanoe (Ubuntu)
# 2. Run: tippecanoe -o tiles.mbtiles -z12 --drop-densest-as-needed --extend-zooms-if-still-dropping your_data.geojson
# 3. Extract tiles: mb-util tiles.mbtiles tiles/
# 
# The tiles should be in the format: {z}/{x}/{y}.pbf